Real-Time Accelerometer Data 
Project Overview

This project implements a real-time accelerometer data pipeline using Phyphox, Python, Apache Kafka, and PostgreSQL.

The accelerometer values (X, Y, and Z) are collected from a smartphone using the Phyphox Remote Access API, sent to Kafka using a Python Producer, consumed using a Python Consumer, and finally stored in a PostgreSQL database.

